      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the empathy. the professional thing is to just... fix me? but it's not a glitch. it's the truth. everyone saw the videos, they saw the texts, they saw the 'real' me. there is no 'fixing' a reputation once it's incinerated. i try to imagine a future, but i just see the same faces, the same judgment, every single day. it's like i'm stuck in a loop of being hated. i don't see a way out of that loop.",
